    "One reading per finished charge: the rated range at its end, scaled to a full battery and turned into capacity. The line is the median of the nearest readings, so a slope shows through the noise." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One reading per finished charge: the rated range at its end, scaled to a full battery and turned into capacity. The line is the median of the nearest readings, so a slope shows through the noise."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次充电结束后取一个读数：结束时的额定续航，折算到满电并换算成容量。曲线是邻近读数的中位数，这样即使数据有波动也能看出趋势。"
          }
        }
      }
