    "Every stored level counts until the next reading, so a parked car counts for the level it sat at. Orange is the time outside the twenty to eighty band." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every stored level counts until the next reading, so a parked car counts for the level it sat at. Orange is the time outside the twenty to eighty band."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每段停留时间都按当时记录的电量计算，所以停放中的车也计入它停放时的电量。橙色表示电量在 20 %–80 % 区间之外的时间。"
          }
        }
      }
